<p>Lord knows I have trouble finding files sometimes. Over the years I’ve tried lots of schemes in Org Mode and elsewhere for the sole purpose of keeping track of stray items. Using <a href="https://chrismaiorana.com/org-file-includes/">includes</a> in Org Mode has been helpful, but I didn’t have a way of <i>jumping</i> to those included files for quick access. Until now! Read on.</p>
<p>In this article, we’ll look at:</p>
<div id="table-of-contents" role="doc-toc">
